Denoting $\on{Res}$ the restriction from $\DG$ to $\Delta\{\Gen_0\}$,  we obtain
	a sequence of functors
	\[
		\DG \overset{\text{Yoneda}}{\lra} \Set_{\DG} \overset{\on{Res^*}}{\lra}
		\Set_{\Delta \{ \Gen_0 \}} \overset{\ref{prop:main}}{\lra} \Gen_0-\Set_{\Delta}
			\overset{\FC}{\lra}
			\Gen_0-\Cat
	\]
	whose composite is the desired functor.

